WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.000
F3 views the public Procyon README in the other pane.

00:00:03.000 --> 00:00:06.000
F4 opens the README for editing. We close it without saving.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Pack the README into a ZIP archive.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
The new README.zip stays beside the source file.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.500
F5 copies that ZIP to the empty ~/Downloads/test folder.

00:00:14.500 --> 00:00:17.500
The ZIP is now in both panes; the original remains untouched.
